     "id": "p1",
     "text": "Previously, on the Keeper’s Island."
    },
    {
     "id": "p2",
     "text": "Under the lighthouse, a false lamp was wrecking ships, and the stranger lighting it was Gus’s own mother."
    },
    {
     "id": "p3",
     "text": "She owed the sea four ships for four years of life. Gus closed her lamp. And she left her coat on the rocks.",
     "pause": 0.4
